  <!-- Mind Killer -->
  <Weapon_USGrenade_MindKill.label>心灵杀手手雷</Weapon_USGrenade_MindKill.label>
  <Weapon_USGrenade_MindKill.description>这种手雷会释放出一种神经毒剂， 这种化学物质会严重损伤神经系统.</Weapon_USGrenade_MindKill.description>
  <Weapon_USGrenade_MindKill.verbs.0.label>扔出手雷</Weapon_USGrenade_MindKill.verbs.0.label>
